codemirror-lang-mermaid
https://github.com/inspirnathan/codemirror-lang-mermaid, vendored from the fork
at https://github.com/Edge-Tools/codemirror-lang-mermaid. The dispatcher and the
grammars that the sections below do not name come from it, changed since.
